(text "AD7124-8, isolators, GPIO expander, Raspberry Pi header" (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f3862232-c235-5030-bbb9-1ae253b28444))
(text "SPI (ADuM1401): Pi SCLK/MOSI/CE0 -> VIA/VIB/VIC -> AD7124 SCLK/DIN/CS; DOUT/RDY -> VID -> VOD -> Pi MISO. VE1/VE2 tied high." (at 20 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f3d8d584-c45f-5dc3-9478-c67c1244dc0f))
(text "I2C (ADuM1250): Pi SDA1/SCL1 (on-board 1.8k pull-ups) <-> SDA2/SCL2 bus with R501/R502 2.2k: AD5933 @0x0D, TCA9534 @0x20." (at 20 30.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bcebde74-c5c4-5a06-8e08-6c4e7f2fb13b))
(text "TCA9534 P0..P4 = SWCTRL1..5 (0 = passive, 1 = EIS); P5 = SW_EN (R206 pull-down: switches off until firmware configures P5 as output-high)." (at 20 33.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a3054927-9be7-5294-b40c-df5ce29383fe))
(text "AD7124-8: internal 614.4 kHz clock (CLK NC), internal 2.5 V ref buffered on REFOUT -> VCM divider. Suggested config: full power, sinc4," (at 20 35.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 15311b9a-7dcd-5988-af91-d39d3a223b08))
(text "  FS = 75 -> ODR = 19200/75 = 256 SPS, gain 1, AIN0(+)/AIN1(-), input buffers on, bipolar." (at 20 38.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 322e6a6a-f239-5b28-8cdb-e60f06b03e44))
